#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:83
#: ef90b41fd4984be6bfcd6348d6231734
msgid "Can FD port"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:85
#: fdb2e35398b34527b791fe171c1a9489
msgid "This flight controller includes a 4-pin DroneCAN standard CAN port. It's capable of 64-byte frames, and up to 5Mbps data rates. It's useful for connecting GPS devices, compasses, power monitoring, sensors, motors, servos, and other CAN peripherals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:89
#: ed87ca88e82a4d69a55f63e7e02b503c
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:91
#: 79d673c143ce4192b0cad717ab4f6940
msgid "This flight controller includes a 2.4Ghz ExpressLRS transceiver, capable of receiving control input, and transmitting or receiving MavLink telemetry. To enable all ELRS features, either RC5 channel should be setup as an ARM switch (there are several RC5_OPTIONS that can do this) or by mapping the transmitter's Channel 5 to reflect ARM status from telemetry. See: https://youtu.be/YO2yA1fmZBs for an example."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:93
#: 8250ceae92fb4290aecacd4b445be045
msgid "SBUS on the DJI connector may be used if SERIAL5_PROTOCOL is changed to 0 and SERIAL1_PROTOCOL is changed to 23 for RC input."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:96
#: b3ef857d801b4a48a2d0f39f6776d6bf
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:98
#: e440c42420f14097bbd35349902b951b
msgid "The Anyleafh7 supports up to 8 PWM outputs. Outputs 1-4 are available via an JST-SH connectors. All 8 outputs support DShot and bi-directional DShot, as well as all PWM types."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:100
#: 9be770ed51264ee0b8e1479489c4aa75
msgid "The PWM is in 3 groups:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:102
#: 2f041b86e02d43878f49b97ec2da05ea
msgid "PWM 1-4 in group1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:103
#: 98c58a6d78af46f480324ec379a14817
msgid "PWM 5, 6 in group2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:104
#: 07cdd9b472b741a2814a0f65066e2863
msgid "PWM 7, 8 in group3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:106
#: 8bfb149ba62e4437a7bf8a9271f8debf
msgid "Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate, whether PWM or Dshot. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use DShot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:111
#: 8983c3f21f9940f7a476690e16786c99
msgid "Magnetometer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-anyleafh7.rst:112
#: a43222c69b7a4b8bad4c584982c15ca2
msgid "This flight controller does not have a built-in magnetometer, but you can attach an external one using the CAN connector, or the I2C pads on the bottom."
msgstr ""

